{"id":5250,"date":"2025-10-14T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-10-14T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=5250"},"modified":"2025-10-10T16:17:36","modified_gmt":"2025-10-10T15:17:36","slug":"5-useful-apps-for-starting-entrepreneurs","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/5-useful-apps-for-starting-entrepreneurs\/","title":{"rendered":"5 Useful Apps for Starting Entrepreneurs"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a new entrepreneur, it can sometimes feel like you have a thousand things to do at once. From your paperwork to social media, the to-do list seems endless.<br>Luckily, there are smart apps that can make your life as an entrepreneur a little easier! They streamline your processes and save you valuable time, so you can focus on what really matters.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this blog, we&#8217;ve listed 5 apps that every starting entrepreneur should have and\/or know!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>App #1: Canva<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:37% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"277\" height=\"277\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142239-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5252 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142239-1.png 277w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142239-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 277px) 100vw, 277px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want to build a strong social media presence? Then\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.canva.com\/\"><strong>Canva<\/strong><\/a>\u00a0is an absolute must-have! This app lets you create professional visuals for your channels in no time. Think Instagram posts, Stories, flyers, and logos. You don&#8217;t need a graphic designer; with Canva&#8217;s tool, you can create beautiful designs yourself.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>App #2: Fiverr<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:37% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"273\" height=\"271\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142537.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5253 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142537.png 273w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142537-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 273px) 100vw, 273px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nl.fiverr.com\/?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc-brand&amp;utm_campaign=g_nl-nl_brand_desktop_exact&amp;utm_term=one-fiverr_(exact)&amp;utm_content=AdID^659692960469^Keyword^fiverr^Placement^^Device^c&amp;caid=10747319512&amp;agid=112874093744&amp;ad_id=659692960469&amp;kw=fiverr&amp;lpcat=&amp;show_join=true&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=10747319512&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADsPu6u-hTaXB18wMSX8jM0X8bT0Z&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwqqDFBhDhARIsAIHTlkv90oFpjNWRHc9inO2tH_DMfMbhf2vJLUiUfBU38frbcP5Xs9ebuZYaAu5KEALw_wcB\">Fiverr<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0is a handy app that connects you with freelancers worldwide. You&#8217;ll find professionals for virtually any task you want to outsource. Whether you need a logo designed, social media posts created, a video edited, or an animation created, the possibilities are endless.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>App #3: Google Drive<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:40% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"274\" height=\"273\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142707.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5255 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142707.png 274w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-142707-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 274px) 100vw, 274px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/\">Google Drive,<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0you have access to all your files anytime, anywhere. This is perfect for when you&#8217;re on the go or waiting somewhere and want to spend the time productively focused on your business. You can also manage your files through similar services, such as Dropbox or Microsoft OneDrive.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>App #4: Trello<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:40% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"712\" height=\"435\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143612.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5258 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143612.png 712w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143612-300x183.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 712px) 100vw, 712px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trello lets you organize everything. It&#8217;s primarily used to track project progress. You create columns like &#8220;to do,&#8221; &#8220;in progress,&#8221; and &#8220;done.<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/trello.com\/nl\">&#8220;<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0Tasks placed under these columns can then be easily moved from one column to the next.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>App #5: Later.com<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:41% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"526\" height=\"421\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143914.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5259 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143914.png 526w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-07-143914-300x240.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 526px) 100vw, 526px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Are you building a strong social media brand? Then you know you need to post regularly. But doing it manually is time-consuming, which is why we recommend\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/later.com\/\">Later.com<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0.<br>This tool lets you quickly and easily schedule all of your social media posts for platforms like Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, LinkedIn, and X.<br>Scheduling your posts once a month will save you a tremendous amount of time.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\